Z||000006||CozmoPooky||02-07-2001||09:05 AM||||Hey Jeff,<BR>   It's a stock Coupe that the PO had put an aero nose on from a pre-87 (ribbed trim, I have to change them to smooth).  It has no ground effects on the sides or rear, no spoiler and body color mirrors. The PO also painted the "wings" (lower part of the nose in front of the wheels) black to match the stock rocker panels. Future body mods are an "Archie" style front scoop, side scoops, Mustang rear scoop, white engine grilles, and solid red taillights.  I think it looks real clean and uncluttered.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/duke1.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>CozmoPooky<BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>'87 Duke Coupe     <BR>'85 2M6 Targa<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bothfierossig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
